{"id":"vod_sn_37651","vodId":"37651","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"初音岛II","name_cn":"初音岛II","date":"2007-01-01","year":"2007","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ea554d7646ea8577134259aacc4bd517.jpg"},"summary":"樱花静静的飞舞着。　　浅粉色的樱花终年绽放的岛。　　——冬季。　　地表微镀着银色的霜花，空中飘舞着纯白的结晶。　　连吐出的气息都是白色的，起床也需要下很大的决心。　　虽说如此——　　“此处的樱花仍是这样绽放着……”　　走在开满樱花的上学路上的少年义之说道。　　“永不凋零的樱花是初音岛的特色嘛”　　“你又不是不知道这个”　　走在前边的少女回头说。　　一个人看起来很开心，而另一个稍微有些厌倦。　　这是司空见惯的景色。　　少年仰望着像春季里一般绽放的樱花，呵出白色的气息。　　圣诞Party日益临近。而且，明年就是附属最后一年了。　　邂逅和离别，欢乐和悲伤交织的时刻……　　不知等待自己的将是什么。　　但——确实感到了不同的气息。凝望着轻轻地飘舞的樱花，少年似乎看到了来年的春……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dhMT7pxfZE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/MRRd0TUz101/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/r5LbhKt1iz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Csxq0e04Fi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kQJPdwkQTA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jBgmHvegVj1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4UTuudViuc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uzG8dXAyQ11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xHLF1g08ue1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7gZ7uiWzJP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zpdYLwAvTZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CSQ3Aing2Y1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GWTPPUsJk21/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:08.468Z"}